<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2119285155"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1726739248"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="感傷生命"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ナナツカゼ / PIKASONIC / なこたんまる"/><amll:meta key="album" value="感傷生命"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:25.410"><div begin="00:01.041" end="03:25.410"><p begin="00:01.041" end="00:05.974" itunes:key="L1">息のしやすい場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直以来所探寻的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki no shi ya su i ba sho</span></p><p begin="00:05.975" end="00:12.269" itunes:key="L2">ここじゃないと探していた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能让我自如呼吸的地方并非这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ja na i to sa ga shi te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:12.270" end="00:17.250" itunes:key="L3">死に損ない人達<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些寻死未果的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ni so ko na i hi to ta chi</span></p><p begin="00:17.251" end="00:20.365" itunes:key="L4">他人事じゃない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非与我毫无瓜葛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to go to ja na i</span></p><p begin="00:20.366" end="00:25.689" itunes:key="L5">ダラダラ生きてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">懒懒散散地残喘至今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ra da ra i ki te ta</span></p><p begin="00:25.690" end="00:29.284" itunes:key="L6">順番がきた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经轮到我了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ju n ba n ga ki ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.377" end="00:42.633" itunes:key="L7">僕は行く遠く遠く遠くに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将前往无比遥远的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha i ku to o ku to o ku to o ku ni</span></p><p begin="00:42.634" end="00:50.047" itunes:key="L8">消費期限付きの鼓動を鳴らして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让终将迎来期限的心跳恣意拍打</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u hi ki ge n tsu ki no ko do u wo na ra shi te</span></p><p begin="00:50.048" end="00:53.600" itunes:key="L9">もう終わらして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让一切到此为止吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u o wa ra shi te</span></p><p begin="00:53.601" end="00:54.725" itunes:key="L10">いいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i i yo</span></p><p begin="00:57.455" end="01:02.402" itunes:key="L11">何かは分かりはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对周遭的一切一无所知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ka ha wa ka ri ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:02.403" end="01:08.738" itunes:key="L12">ただ何かが離れていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却总有什么在离我而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da na ni ka ga ha na re te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:08.739" end="01:13.689" itunes:key="L13">君からの贈り物<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你赠予我的种种事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ka ra no o ku ri mo no</span></p><p begin="01:13.690" end="01:22.209" itunes:key="L14">この命すら今は憎い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至让我在此刻厌恶起自己的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no i no chi su ra i ma ha ni ku i</span></p><p begin="01:30.993" end="01:36.623" itunes:key="L15">永遠を失った代償に自由を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以失去永远作为代价获得自由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n wo u shi na 't ta da i sho u ni ji yu u wo</span></p><p begin="01:36.624" end="01:39.617" itunes:key="L16">でも不自由の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却只有在不自由的海中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo fu ji yu u no</span></p><p begin="01:39.618" end="01:42.267" itunes:key="L17">海の中だけの自由で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才能感受到这份自由而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u mi no na ka da ke no ji yu u de</span></p><p begin="01:42.268" end="01:45.960" itunes:key="L18">感傷的な命のままじゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅凭这如此感伤的生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n sho u te ki na i no chi no ma ma ja</span></p><p begin="01:45.961" end="01:52.448" itunes:key="L19">ここでは呼吸できない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法让我在此自如呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de ha ko kyu u de ki na i</span></p><p begin="01:53.195" end="01:56.108" itunes:key="L20">空は言う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空这样说道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ha i u</span></p><p begin="01:56.109" end="02:04.538" itunes:key="L21">「誰も悪くないよ」 って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“其实任何人都没有错”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 da re mo wa ru ku na i yo 」 't te</span></p><p begin="02:04.539" end="02:11.688" itunes:key="L22">頷いて少しまた歩きだすんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对此予以认同再次朝前走了些许</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u na zu i te su ko shi ma ta a ru ki da su n da</span></p><p begin="02:11.689" end="02:16.551" itunes:key="L23">わかった振りをした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装自己什么都明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't ta fu ri wo shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:27.062" end="02:38.281" itunes:key="L24">僕は行く遠く遠く遠くに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将前往无比遥远的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha i ku to o ku to o ku to o ku ni</span></p><p begin="02:38.282" end="02:45.759" itunes:key="L25">消費期限切れの命を燃やして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让终将迎来期限的生命竭力燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u hi ki ge n gi re no i no chi wo mo ya shi te</span></p><p begin="02:45.760" end="02:49.362" itunes:key="L26">もう終わらすの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就要到此为止了吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u o wa ra su no ？</span></p><p begin="02:49.363" end="03:25.410" itunes:key="L27">いいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i i yo</span></p></div></body></tt>